        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nDNG McGill Longford & carrick on Shannon are proud to present this . c.2.67 acre site located on Folio LD9122 with stunning countryside views, ideally located close to Longford Town and just off the N5.The site are just 3 minutes from N5 and 5 minutes' drive from Longford Town.The site is regular shaped and subject to planning can be 2 No sites of approx. 1.3 Acres each.Longford Town has an abundance pubs and restaurants, and is a commuter location from Dublin with 8 trains daily to Dublin This prime residential site will be sold subject to planning permission from Longford Co. Co. Full maps available from The Auctioneer."
